cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TensorCorePTX: PTX Tensor Core GEMM Exploration"
abstract: >-
  Hand-written PTX GEMM kernels (cp.async, ldmatrix, mma.sync) for fp16,
  int8, and int4 on NVIDIA Ada (SM89), with a benchmarking/verification
  harness, Nsight Compute profiling results, and PyTorch bindings.
  Quantized PTX kernels reach up to 34.4x (int8) and 98.7x (int4)
  speedup over an fp16 WMMA baseline at N=8192 on an NVIDIA L4.
